  "thig14.1:9.1": "Arthaśastra 2.13.51 describes how to alloy the  <i lang='pi' translate='no'>tapanīya</i> (“glittering gold”) that is ready to be worked. ",
  "thig14.1:9.2": "",
  "thig14.1:9.3": "",
