  "thig14.1:31.1": "For <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cārudassanā</i>, compare Sanskrit <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cārulocanā</i>, “she whose eyes are fair”. <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thig14.1/en/sujato#18.2'>Thig 14.1:18.2</a> above has already established the sense “eye” for <i lang='pi' translate='no'>dassana</i>. ",
  "thig14.1:31.2": "For <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pajjittha</i>, compare Sanskrit <i lang='pi' translate='no'>apādi</i>, “fall into ruin”. ",
